{"connection_id": "BC-8bcab21aa5ad368d163a", "ref": "WLC:Jer.32.14", "target": "sec10", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "deed preserved for the future", "note": "The deed is placed in an earthen vessel so it may last many days; this closely matches the commentary's entrusted legacy preserved for successors."}
