{"connection_id": "BC-c24e769b6931581f7245", "ref": "WLC:Ruth.4.9", "target": "sec10", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "witnesses to a property transfer", "note": "Boaz calls the elders and people as witnesses that he has acquired Elimelech's property; this joins property succession to public testimony as the commentary does."}
