{"connection_id": "BC-cdbce201a93dd058d9de", "ref": "WLC:Zech.8.17", "target": "sec10", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "false oath rejected with harmful intent", "note": "The next instruction rejects plotting harm against a neighbor and loving a false oath; the commentary's contested witnesses unite the same dangers of malice and sworn deception."}

